'''Republicanism in Qym''' is a political position and movement that believes [[Qym]] should be a [[wikipedia:republic|republic]]. Currently, Qym is an [[wikipedia:absolute monarchy|absolute monarchy]] that has the [[King of Qym]] as head of state and head of government. 

Supporters of the movement tend to call for a parliamentary democracy based on a [[RIVAL DEMOCRACY]] model, with freedom of speech and political pluralism. The republican movement vary in political ideology, ranging from liberals to socialists, anarchists, and [[TBD]] and [[TBD]] minority activists. 

